00:22:52.726 --> 00:22:55.610
on any kind of aliasing,

00:22:55.611 --> 00:22:57.650
any kind of pointers, and so
on that have been set up.

00:22:57.651 --> 00:22:59.060
Don't think
those techniques don't

00:22:59.061 --> 00:23:01.025
do good program
analysis, they do.

00:23:01.026 --> 00:23:01.525
&gt;&gt; Okay.

