00:25:08.171 --> 00:25:09.640
which is actually
partially-merged,

00:25:09.641 --> 00:25:11.250
and then we can actually merge

00:25:11.251 --> 00:25:13.040
partially-merged regions until we

00:25:13.041 --> 00:25:14.760
